# Exception: mcp-server/lib is a SOURCE package, not a build artifact.
# Without this, `railway up` applies the generic lib/ rule above and drops
# the source dir from the deploy image -> ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'lib'.
!mcp-server/lib/
!mcp-server/lib/**
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

